Other tools mentioned in the skill
----------------------------------

The skill may instruct the LLM to suggest these third-party packages.
None are bundled here; each is fetched by the user's TeX Live installer:

  * pgfplots                 LPPL 1.3+
    https://github.com/pgf-tikz/pgfplots
  * TikZ / PGF               LPPL 1.3+
    https://github.com/pgf-tikz/pgf
  * pgfgantt                 LPPL 1.3+
    https://www.ctan.org/pkg/pgfgantt
  * biblatex / biber         LPPL 1.3+ / Artistic 2.0
    https://github.com/plk/biblatex
    https://github.com/plk/biber
  * siunitx                  LPPL 1.3c+
    https://github.com/josephwright/siunitx
  * booktabs                 LPPL 1.3+
    https://www.ctan.org/pkg/booktabs
  * subcaption               LPPL 1.3+
    https://www.ctan.org/pkg/subcaption
  * tcolorbox                LPPL 1.3+
    https://github.com/T-F-S/tcolorbox
  * metropolis (theme)       Creative Commons CC-BY-SA 4.0
    https://github.com/matze/mtheme

